Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The per-agent harness in `harness/` is adapted from the Terminus 2 agent in
terminal-bench:

    terminal-bench (Terminus 2)
    https://github.com/laude-institute/terminal-bench  @ 1a6ffa9
    Copyright (c) The terminal-bench authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Specifically, the following modules adapt Terminus 2's prompt/loop shape,
response schema, chat-history management, LiteLLM wrapper, and tmux shell
strategy. Each carries an attribution header pointing at the upstream commit:

    harness/chat.py     — alternating-role chat history + trim/summarize
    harness/llm.py      — LiteLLM completion wrapper + retry taxonomy
    harness/parser.py   — {analysis, plan, commands, task_complete} JSON/XML parser
    harness/shell.py    — tmux-backed persistent bash strategy
    harness/loop.py     — main agent loop wiring

